==== hyperbricks yaml {!{api_render}} ====
api_render:
  - type: api_render
  - debug: "true"
  - debugpanel: "true"
  - endpoint: https://example.com/api
  - method: GET
==== explainer ====
Log request and response metadata only; never header values, URL paths or queries, or payloads
